---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Rules of Membership" description="Membership rules, categories, and termination policies of Sarvagun Society.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-8">Rules of Membership</h1>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">General Member</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Any major individual of sound mind and integrity having unflinching faith in the aims and objectives of the society can become a General Member with voting rights.</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-text mt-2">Membership Fee: ₹1,000 per year</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Associate Member</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Enrolled after 2+ years of contribution to the society</li>
            <li>One-time fee of ₹1,000</li>
            <li>Voting rights in the General Body</li>
            <li>3-year term (extendable or curtailable by EC)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Donor Member</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Any person or institution donating ₹1,00,000 or more in cash or kind gets voting rights in the General Body.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Honorary Member</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Persons of remarkable achievement in any field may be enrolled without any fee. They may attend important EC meetings and offer suggestions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Patrons</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Eminent persons of proven excellence may be nominated as Patrons. No membership fee required. May be invited to important meetings but no voting rights.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Termination of Membership</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Working against the interests, objectives, and reputation of the society</li>
            <li>Death, resignation, unsound mind, insolvency, or criminal conviction</li>
            <li>Missing three consecutive meetings without prior notice</li>
            <li>Non-payment of dues for three months after due date</li>
            <li>Resignation by letter to President or Secretary</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
